{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Dishnote 是一款把網頁、朋友分享與手寫食譜集中整理的食譜收藏工具，適合經常下廚、想快速查找與靈活調整份量的人使用。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-209.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>食譜整理與烹調輔助</h2>\n<p>Dishnote 可透過連結或分享選單匯入網頁食譜，自動整理標題、材料、步驟與烹調時間，亦支援手動輸入。調整份量時材料用量會同步更新，並可從步驟直接啟動計時器，即使離開應用程式仍會收到通知。你亦可加入筆記、照片、分類與收藏，按名稱或材料搜尋，並以純文字分享食譜。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-199-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-200-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-201-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-202-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Dishnote</li><li>應用類別：Food &amp; Drink</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/dishnote/id6828005739?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T22:01:22.938510+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":288,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T21:37:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T23:37:32.818124+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T21:54:53.415078+00:00","content_hash":"84cf95c0456b9d877044399e8cfc03138028c0bd887e6db7951b4bd1880ca3cb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T22:01:22.938510+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}